{"seq":2,"slug":"legibility-and-navigation","title":"Legibility And Navigation","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clear-structure-and-naming","title":"清晰的结构与命名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/clear-structure-and-naming","wordCount":2150,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"locality-and-modularity","title":"局部性与模块化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/locality-and-modularity","wordCount":1868,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"explicit-over-implicit","title":"显式胜于隐式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/explicit-over-implicit","wordCount":1790,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲让 agent(和人)能快速读懂、定位、导航代码库的三个支柱:清晰的结构与命名,让代码自我解释、降低理解所需的上下文;局部性与模块化,让一次改动的影响半径足够小、可在有限上下文里完成;以及显式胜于隐式,把隐藏的约定、魔法、远距离耦合变成可见的代码——减少 agent 必须「猜」的部分,正是减少它出错的部分。</p>\n"}